title: Remove unused ChildBountyCount storage item from pallet-child-bounties
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `ChildBountyCount` was replaced by per-parent counters in a previous migration and is no
    longer read anywhere, so this removes the storage item from the pallet. The storage version
    stays at 1: the raw value, where it still exists on-chain, is cleaned up separately with
    `RemoveStorage<ChildBountyCount>` in the runtimes that need it, rather than an in-pallet
    migration.
crates:
- name: pallet-child-bounties
  bump: major
